          "quote": "请药师把药盒上的准确药名和用法读给你听"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01057",
          "explanation": "The caregiver confirmed that the pharmacist checked the hospital system and clarified the medicines.",
          "quote": "药师看了药袋和他们系统"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "A specific medication-information gap was identified, an immediate responsible channel was assigned, and the caregiver returned with confirmation from that channel. This actively repaired an otherwise unsafe discharge-medication ambiguity, although the doctor subsequently undermined part of that repair by inventing a rebamipide schedule.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
